\section*{L-ToEC MASTER v5.3}
This release (v5.3) extends the composition law to include a resource-bounded composition perspective (latency, error, energy). See docs/physics/specs for prototype Z3 and SymPy artifacts.

\subsection*{What's new}
- Added prototype Z3 axioms for additive and convex composition of per-mapping costs.
- Added SymPy symbolic checks and a numeric example.
- Appended v5.3 roadmap to \texttt{feedback\_recent.txt}.

